// including all necessary modules (be careful of mulitple inclusion)
.include "binadder.jsim"

// checkoff header
.checkoff "" "Exhaustive test of 4-bit binary adder module" 0

* 1. Instantiate the module for testing
* make sure the ports are in right order
* Uncomment to test respective binary adder

// Xrca4 a[3:0] b[3:0] ci co s[3:0] rca4         // for testing RC4
// Xcsa4 a[3:0] b[3:0] ci co s[3:0] csa4         // for testing CSA4
Xcla4 a[3:0] b[3:0] ci co s[3:0] g h cla4_co  // for testing CLA4_co

* 2. Veirfication of outputs
* Verifying output s[3:0]
.verify s[3:0] periodic(9.9E-8,1.0000000000000001E-7)
